    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "guide",
        "speaker": "Guide",
        "sourceStart": 7,
        "sourceEnd": 215,
        "text": "Welcome to the City Museum. Today, we'll explore three galleries. Although the museum is small, it has a surprising collection. Let me start with the oldest piece, which is a bronze bowl from the Han Dynasty.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "579206b160c8f2536f8620992a32b9310e5ca022452f78cb3faf162a349a7d24",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "visitor",
        "speaker": "Visitor",
        "sourceStart": 225,
        "sourceEnd": 282,
        "text": "Excuse me, is that bowl real? I mean, is it the original?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "9f7326332ff60ec245a6bffb550efa21b2adbc3a9101bdba244f049dada6014f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "guide",
        "speaker": "Guide",
        "sourceStart": 290,
        "sourceEnd": 444,
        "text": "Good question. It's a replica, not the original. The original is too fragile to display. But even though it's a copy, it's made using traditional methods.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "0958b1c10d8aae417b31ce007f54d2a76b9638d668cbf3c8d8a42f5df44b473a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "visitor",
        "speaker": "Visitor",
        "sourceStart": 454,
        "sourceEnd": 528,
        "text": "I see. And what about the painting next to it? The one with the mountains?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "4154102f92568ad5f9334993cc99eaacf4ecaa549a681d0eea92b67c0f295ecb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "guide",
        "speaker": "Guide",
        "sourceStart": 536,
        "sourceEnd": 664,
        "text": "That's a landscape by a local artist, painted in 1980. It's not ancient, but it's very popular. Many visitors take photos of it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "c969258119c47dd0499202820d0ff774e1075347ade425a9874c5ba946ecd769",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "visitor",
        "speaker": "Visitor",
        "sourceStart": 674,
        "sourceEnd": 728,
        "text": "Oh, I thought it was older. The style looks classical.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "5869944105464d8d43222fd0002945755c79d8d8626bdaaf67c95f2d48e782f0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "guide",
        "speaker": "Guide",
        "sourceStart": 736,
        "sourceEnd": 908,
        "text": "Yes, the artist used classical techniques. Now, let's move to the second gallery, where we have pottery from the Tang Dynasty. These pieces were found in a tomb near Xi'an.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "5323e081c1b66de294adc7bae268bad5e1d71f8315887b42e1787e57ee353557",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "visitor",
        "speaker": "Visitor",
        "sourceStart": 918,
        "sourceEnd": 947,
        "text": "Were they all found together?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "d227810bc116d60e6f302a03c5ff5a981f2fd6d4e43f1b137cc4f99e9a9445ac",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "guide",
        "speaker": "Guide",
        "sourceStart": 955,
        "sourceEnd": 1054,
        "text": "Most of them were, but a few were donated by a private collector. The museum acquired them in 2005.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "d9e8b961db4efd5203d52e7689b1a288ef4536bff7eaf45c6c48877135082878",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "visitor",
        "speaker": "Visitor",
        "sourceStart": 1064,
        "sourceEnd": 1135,
        "text": "That's interesting. So, some are from a tomb and some from a collector?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "2955958702a23e509e07f9c0277be3787c5b8c556d371bdf5a0bd604c4627113",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "guide",
        "speaker": "Guide",
        "sourceStart": 1143,
        "sourceEnd": 1252,
        "text": "Exactly. And here's something special: a small jade horse. It's one of the few items that survived undamaged.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "39d5e339201b5a9a0faf50bf8fa3612198549dc45a8883774c837bb4262a79d5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "visitor",
        "speaker": "Visitor",
        "sourceStart": 1262,
        "sourceEnd": 1293,
        "text": "It's beautiful. Can I touch it?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "8e60a54ee288519435fe982ecf4e97820620db2b064abd33ff0b67ed079fadb2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "guide",
        "speaker": "Guide",
        "sourceStart": 1301,
        "sourceEnd": 1356,
        "text": "I'm afraid not. But you can take a photo without flash.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "d633a0b1d27c2ac83b149c916084e5734e60dcb8a216b855413a56385e4437ab",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "visitor",
        "speaker": "Visitor",
        "sourceStart": 1366,
        "sourceEnd": 1402,
        "text": "OK. And what's in the third gallery?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "78e02bcebdb0e318fcf669b8852aabd927ae5277f5a0047ca3d00e7a86be5883",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "guide",
        "speaker": "Guide",
        "sourceStart": 1410,
        "sourceEnd": 1584,
        "text": "The third gallery focuses on modern art. We have sculptures and paintings from the 20th century. One sculpture, made of recycled metal, is particularly popular with children.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "9258b9de883b1e25bcfb37070a29e9a5696f196f083894be0302aa32e17095bf",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "visitor",
        "speaker": "Visitor",
        "sourceStart": 1594,
        "sourceEnd": 1639,
        "text": "I can imagine. Is there a café in the museum?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "7ab64f1e9904d0cc9f8dd7e9a1258b8618818b8b31f8ce8120f00c5cdc310ef5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "guide",
        "speaker": "Guide",
        "sourceStart": 1647,
        "sourceEnd": 1729,
        "text": "Yes, on the ground floor. It serves snacks and drinks. But it's closed on Mondays.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "7ac835ef4f52e6ed809570e1de1ad90aab4690acc5e07fd38f57737c1d90492e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "visitor",
        "speaker": "Visitor",
        "sourceStart": 1739,
        "sourceEnd": 1773,
        "text": "Good to know. Thanks for the tour!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "62e45beef2bb941b9dab38ea784170fc1665e57396e3c60d63564a5170924052",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "guide",
        "speaker": "Guide",
        "sourceStart": 1781,
        "sourceEnd": 1826,
        "text": "You're welcome. Enjoy the rest of your visit.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "524fdbc6987aa3c44192afed3c0685abc76b80cf78f42b98cae7d0ad78152942",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
